---
---
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="feature-split">
      <div class="feat-text">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--accent-text)">The family hub</span>
        <span class="script script-lg" style="color:var(--accent-text)">Give Parents a Home Base</span>
        <h2 class="headline">A private portal that keeps families engaged.</h2>
        <p class="subhead">A private portal for every family, with their own dashboard: their child's levels and progress, text alerts for pickups and updates, all your center's forms, and internal center pages for awards, events, your leadership team, the method, and resources for success at home. The reasons families stay, in one place.</p>
        <div class="feat-points">
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="7" height="9" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="5" x="14" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="9" x="14" y="12" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">A dashboard for every family</strong><br>Their children's progress, levels, and center info in one private place</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Parents manage their own details</strong><br>Self-update contact info and media-release consent, with an audit trail</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Co-parent visibility</strong><br>Each guardian sees the children they are linked to, resolved securely</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-demo" data-cta="Learn More">Learn More</a>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-visual">
        <div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(224,113,44,.15),transparent 68%);width:120%;height:120%;top:-10%;left:-10%"></div>
        <div class="shot"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1945" height="1633" src="/images/parent-portal.webp" alt="Parent portal family dashboard"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
